::MCR_U02_Pretest_Q01::
Question ID: MCR_U02_Pretest_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.MCR.AR.1
Question:
Unit 2 readiness item for MLA.MCR.AR.1. Which answer best matches the modeled context?
{
=A. Correct model or interpretation#Correct when this is the marked answer. The response matches the model and context.
~B. Uses the wrong operation or symbol#This reflects a common operation or symbol mistake.
~C. Ignores the context or units#This ignores the units or real-world meaning.
~D. Uses a nonviable answer#This may solve numerically but does not make sense in context.
}
